.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
.Dd October 12, 2026
.Dt DTFL_COLLECTION_DELAY_NEU 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtfl_collection_delay_neu ,
.Nm dtfl_collection_differentiate ,
.Nm dtfl_collection_integrate
.Nd AltNeu timing and the differential calculus for delta queries
.Sh LIBRARY
Timely and differential dataflow library
.Pq libdtfl , \-ldtfl
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In dtfl/dogs.h
.Ft dtfl_collection *
.Fn dtfl_collection_delay_neu "dtfl_collection *c"
.Ft dtfl_collection *
.Fn dtfl_collection_differentiate "dtfl_collection *c" "dtfl_scope *child"
.Ft dtfl_collection *
.Fn dtfl_collection_integrate "dtfl_collection *c"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
A delta query runs in an
.Vt AltNeu
scope
.Pq Fn dtfl_time_altneu .
A time in such a scope is one coordinate encoding a base time
.Va t
and a bit
.Va neu
as
.Li 2t + neu ,
so the
.Dq alt
copy of a time is even and the
.Dq neu
copy is odd.
Entering the scope places updates at their alt times; a relation that
appears after the delta stream in the join order is moved to its neu time,
so every pair of concurrent updates interacts exactly once.
.Pp
.Fn dtfl_collection_delay_neu
re-times every update of
.Va c
from its alt time to its neu time, keeping the base time
.Pq upstream Dq .delay(|t| AltNeu::neu(t.time)) .
The scope of
.Va c
must be an
.Vt AltNeu
scope.
.Pp
.Fn dtfl_collection_differentiate
enters the
.Vt AltNeu
scope
.Va child
and presents
.Va c
as its instantaneous changes: each update
.Pq data , alt(t) , diff
is emitted together with
.Pq data , neu(t) , \-diff ,
so the accumulated collection holds each change only at the moment it
occurs.
The diff class of
.Va c
must be Abelian, and
.Va child
must directly refine the scope of
.Va c .
.Pp
.Fn dtfl_collection_integrate
reconstructs a collection from its instantaneous changes: every neu update
is discarded and every alt update has its wrapper stripped, leaving the
scope for its parent.
The scope of
.Va c
must be an
.Vt AltNeu
scope.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Each function returns a new
.Vt dtfl_collection
handle the caller frees with
.Fn dtfl_collection_free .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dtfl_collection_extend 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_collection_index_new 3 ,
.Xr dtfl_time_altneu 3
.Sh STANDARDS
A C11 port of the dogsdogsdogs
.Pa src/altneu.rs
and
.Pa src/calculus.rs .
